### =========================================================================
### SpendSync API: 03. Purchasing Orders & Goods Receiving
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tenantId = 79ef8bff-1d87-4088-ab87-935989a568d5

### 1. List Vendors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/purchasing/vendors
Authorization: Bearer {{procurementToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 2. List Purchase Orders (PO)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/purchasing/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{procurementToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 3. Issue Purchase Order to Vendor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/purchasing/orders/po-2026-0001-id/issue
Authorization: Bearer {{procurementToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 4. List Pending Orders for Warehouse Receiving
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/receiving/orders/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{cfoToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 5. Create Goods Receipt Note (GRN)
# @name createGrn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/receiving/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{cfoToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseOrderId": "po-2026-0001-id",
  "waybillNumber": "IRS-2026-99042",
  "notes": "Physical inspection completed at Gebze Facility",
  "lineItems": [
    {
      "purchaseOrderLineItemId": "po-line-001-id",
      "quantityReceived": 2,
      "quantityAccepted": 2,
      "quantityDamaged": 0,
      "quantityRejected": 0,
      "qualityInspectionNotes": "Unboxing passed. Serial numbers verified."
    }
  ]
}
